From f9084ddf017d9f393bba3be3cab8fd6d9dcfc817 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AI Developer <ai-dev@fatehmusic.local>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 04:12:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(student): add comprehensive student profile (Phase 1)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- migrations/0011: new students table (one row per person, keyed by
  national_code), backfilled from existing registrations; adds
  registrations.student_id as a nullable FK. No existing column
  renamed/removed/altered.
- src/server/students.ts: list (search+status filter+pagination),
  full profile (registrations + certificates + portal-account status),
  update, and find-or-create (used by register.ts going forward).
- src/pages/api/admin/students.ts: GET (list or ?id= single profile),
  PATCH (edit), admin/registrar-gated via existing requireRole.
- src/pages/admin/students.astro (+ students.js, student-profile.js,
  students.css): list view and per-student profile/edit view, in the
  existing admin panel's dark RTL style; nav + dashboard entries added.
- src/pages/api/register.ts: now also upserts into students on every
  new registration, so the table never drifts out of sync with new
  signups. Wrapped defensively -- can never block a successful
  registration, same rule already applied to notifications.

Validated: npx vitest run (85/85, was 70/70 baseline) · npx astro
check (59 errors/4 hints, byte-identical to baseline, none in touched
files) · npx astro build (completes; only the unrelated wrangler
remote-preview step fails, same known sandbox limitation ADR-013
already documented) · full migration chain replayed from scratch
locally · listStudents/getStudentProfile queries manually verified
against local D1 with sample Persian data.
